@startuml DFD_Level_0_Context
!define DBCOLOR #E1F5FE
!define PROCESSCOLOR #FFF9C4
!define ACTORCOLOR #F3E5F5
!define FLOWCOLOR #333333

title DFD Level 0 - Context Diagram\nTime Management System (TMS)

package "Time Management System Boundary" {
    rectangle "Time Management\nSystem (TMS)" as TMS #FFF9C4
}

actor "Executive\n(Multiple)" as EXE #F3E5F5
actor "Secretary\n(Multiple)" as SEC #F3E5F5
database "Email\nService" as EMAIL #E1F5FE

EXE -down-> TMS: Register Appointments\nView Schedules\nMark Leave\nPost Daily Tasks
SEC -down-> TMS: Arrange Meetings\nRearrange Appointments\nManage Multiple Executives
TMS -right-> EXE: Daily Appointment Email\nMeeting Notifications\nSchedule Information
TMS -right-> EMAIL: Send Emails to Executives\nMeeting Confirmations
TMS -left-> SEC: Display Meeting Slots\nRearrangement Suggestions\nStatistics Reports

note right of EXE
  Remote Desktop Users
  Novice Computer Users
end note

note right of SEC
  Remote Desktop Users
  Support for Executives
end note

note bottom of TMS
  Serves Multiple Simultaneous Remote Requests
  Processes: Schedules, Meetings, Leave, Tasks, Statistics
end note

@enduml
